tlp-panel (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Estimated runtime card now answers the charging question too: it retitles
    itself by whether the cable is in, and counts up to the charge limit and
    to a full pack while charging.
  * Runtime projections are made only while discharging. Plugged in, power_now
    reports the charge rate, and dividing by it produced a confident but
    meaningless figure.
  * The battery card counts down to the charge limit while charging.
  * The headline watt reading holds its last value through the second or two
    after the cable moves, when the controller reports zero.
  * Turkish card titles capitalised consistently.
  * English screenshot in the README.

 -- Mehmet Emrah Tunçel <timemrah@gmail.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 03:25:00 +0300

